2) Compile with javac -source 1.7 -target 1.7 into /app/build.
3) Build /app/job.jar with a manifest that sets Main-Class and Class-Path to /opt/legacy-lib/h2-1.3.176.jar so we can run via `java -jar /app/job.jar`.
4) Run the jar, then inspect outputs and do a second run to confirm identical results (at least md5 and files).",
